      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT THE GLOW (2) was out of the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when she broke and finished a distant last over 2200m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder so she can return to form. DOLCE DRAMA (6) made it four minor placings in succession at her latest appearance over 1609m at Hobart when beaten 5 metres into second after being handy in the run. Good enough to take out a race like this. MY BAD (5) is in fine form with a couple of seconds recently, the latest at this track over 2200m. Capable of turning this good form into a well-deserved win. DAISYPEA (3) has drawn to advantage and should give backers a great sight.",
